OL,3,GNEWSA'Batch cooking saves my family of
OL,4,Aeight a fortune'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bristol mum says batch cooking has
OL,7,Fhelped her save hundreds of pounds on
OL,8,Ffeeding her family of eight.
OL,10,FChantelle Gillett, from Filwood in
OL,11,FKnowle West, said batch cooking has
OL,12,Fhelped cut her weekly food bill from
OL,13,Faround #200 to #110.
OL,15,F"It's just been saving me a fortune and
OL,16,Fit gives me a couple of nights off
OL,17,Fcooking as well, which is just
OL,18,Ffantastic for my mental health and
OL,19,Fwellbeing," she said.
